                            Creating Streamlined
                            Safeguarding Processes with
                            OneRen
                        </h3>

                    </div>

                    <!-- READ MORE -->
                    <div class="text-center mt-3">

                        <a
                            href="#"
                            class="text-green-500 text-xs font-medium
                                   hover:text-green-700"
                        >
                            Readmore →
                        </a>

                    </div>

                </div>



                <!-- CARD 2 -->
